    // where the path stops, and every rail on this board stops at a mark
    // that means something: an end tick, a terminal bar, the capsule a
    // shared spur leaves. The cap peeked out beyond all three, so a rail
    // looked like it had run on past its own stop. Treated lines have ended
    // flush all along, for the same reason at their joins; this is the rest
    // of them. Bends are unaffected, being joins rather than caps.
