  // Draw a line and, if its treatment calls for one, the paper overlay that
  // gives it its texture. The overlay is an exact copy of the same geometry,
  // so it follows every bend without being computed twice; it carries no
  // data-metro-role, because it is not a line — it is a hole in one.
