    // shallowest branch was closer to the trunk than the car is tall, and a
    // train on a short spur poked up through the line above it. The car is
    // carAcross() wide across the rail, plus the usual gap between a line
    // and whatever is next to it.
    // A generous fillet. At a small radius a bend is a hinge; at this one a
